"Dots seen only in WISE 2010 are paired with dots seen only in SPHEREx at 4.6 µm, 8″ to 190″ apart and of similar brightness. Each pair is then checked against the target's path, Gaia DR3 and SIMBAD. Asteroids and comets are not checked. An unconfirmed pair is not a discovery.": "只在 WISE 2010 中出现的亮点，会与只在 4.6 µm 的 SPHEREx 中出现的亮点配对，两者相距 8″ 到 190″，亮度相近。然后每一对都会与目标路径、Gaia DR3 和 SIMBAD 核对。小行星和彗星不在检查范围内。未经确认的配对不算发现。",
