"In space, around the Sun and Earth (1 AU apart, one point at this scale). Pink dashed line: our line of sight in the chosen year.": "在太空中，太阳和地球周围（相距 1 AU，在这个比例下只是一个点）。粉色虚线：所选年份我们的视线方向。",
"How: the learnt present-day state is carried through 3D space at constant velocity (the model behind astropy's": "方法：把学到的当前状态以恒定速度带过三维空间（这是 astropy 的",
"). The pink cloud is 300 runs with the starting values varied by their uncertainties. The Galaxy's gravity, which bends real paths over millions of years, and orbits around companions are not included.": "背后的模型）。粉色云团是 300 次运行，起始值按各自的不确定度变化。银河系的引力会在数百万年里弯曲真实路径，伴星的轨道运动也未包括在内。",
