"242 of 242 SPHEREx measurements (100%) were left out because of flagged pixels near the target. None were usable, so there is no spectrum. This object is bright enough to saturate SPHEREx at many wavelengths.": "242 个 SPHEREx 测量值中有 242 个（100%）因目标附近有被标记的像素而被剔除。没有可用的测量值，所以没有光谱。这个天体很亮，会让 SPHEREx 在许多波长上饱和。",
"A measurement is left out if pixels near the target are flagged for: saturation (overflow), bloom, ghosts, streaks, persistence, cross-talk, non-linear pixels, hot, cold or non-functional pixels, missing data, transients, snowballs, halos. This is the conservative set from the SPHEREx Explanatory Supplement. The flipbook pictures hide only broken detector pixels, so bright stars stay visible.": "如果目标附近的像素被标记为以下任一情况，该测量值就会被剔除：饱和（溢出）、光晕扩散（bloom）、鬼影、条纹、残留、串扰、非线性像素、热像素、冷像素或失效像素、数据缺失、瞬变、雪球、晕。这是 SPHEREx 解释性补充文件中的保守设置。翻页图只隐藏损坏的探测器像素，所以亮星仍然可见。",
