"242 images used in all; the pipeline downloads a capped, evenly spread share of the images that overlap the target.": "共使用 242 张图像；处理流程会下载与目标重叠的图像中数量有上限、分布均匀的一部分。",
"Every SPHEREx image: date, detector, wavelength and flags at the target": "每张 SPHEREx 图像：日期、探测器、波长和目标处的标记",
"242 SPHEREx images (5.0′ field). Verdicts:": "242 张 SPHEREx 图像（5.0′ 视场）。判定：",
"0 good": "0 张良好",
"0 caution": "0 张需注意",
"242 poor": "242 张较差",
". 228 saturated at the target pixel. 242 have flags within 3 pixels of the target: OVERFLOW ×241, TRANSIENT ×239, BLOOM ×239, SUR_ERROR ×238, NONFUNC ×27, PERSIST ×10, HALO ×5, HOT ×4, DICHROIC ×3, COLD ×3. 0 are used in the spectrum. Flag names are the SPHEREx pipeline's (Explanatory Supplement); hover a flag for its meaning.": "。228 张在目标像素处饱和。242 张在目标 3 像素内有标记：OVERFLOW ×241、TRANSIENT ×239、BLOOM ×239、SUR_ERROR ×238、NONFUNC ×27、PERSIST ×10、HALO ×5、HOT ×4、DICHROIC ×3、COLD ×3。0 张用于光谱。标记名称来自 SPHEREx 处理流程（解释性补充文件）；把鼠标悬停在标记上可看含义。",
