"How the verdict is decided": "判定是怎么得出的",
"One SPHEREx image is poor when the pixel at the target is saturated (OVERFLOW), blank, outside the image or carries a flag that makes a pixel unusable; caution when the target pixel is fine but another pixel within 3 pixels of the target is flagged or blank (that image is then left out of the spectrum); otherwise good.": "一张 SPHEREx 图像在以下情况判为“较差”：目标处的像素饱和（OVERFLOW）、为空白、在图像之外，或带有使像素不可用的标记；当目标像素没问题，但目标 3 像素内的其他像素被标记或空白时，判为“需注意”（这张图像随后会被排除在光谱之外）；其余判为“良好”。",
"A stacked frame is poor when at least half of its images are poor, or the stacked picture is blank at the target; caution when any image is saturated at the target, at least a quarter are poor, at least half have flagged or blank pixels within 3 pixels of the target, or an image did not pass the SPHEREx pipeline's own quality check (L2DQAFLG); otherwise good. A frame of one image takes that image's verdict.": "叠加画面在至少一半图像较差，或叠加图在目标处为空白时判为“较差”；当任一图像在目标处饱和、至少四分之一较差、至少一半在目标 3 像素内有标记或空白像素，或有图像未通过 SPHEREx 处理流程自身的质量检查（L2DQAFLG）时，判为“需注意”；其余判为“良好”。只有一张图像的画面沿用该图像的判定。",
"The combined frame is poor when at least half of its detector co-adds are poor; caution when any co-add is poor, any image is saturated at the target, or at least half of the co-adds need caution; otherwise good.": "合并画面在其探测器叠加图至少一半较差时判为“较差”；当任一叠加图较差、任一图像在目标处饱和，或至少一半叠加图需注意时，判为“需注意”；其余判为“良好”。",
"WISE and NEOWISE frames come without flag planes here, so only blank pixels and a saturated (blanked) core are checked: poor when the core is saturated or the target pixel is blank, caution when a pixel within 3 pixels of the target is blank.": "这里的 WISE 和 NEOWISE 画面没有标记层，所以只检查空白像素和饱和（被置空）的核心：核心饱和或目标像素空白时判为“较差”，目标 3 像素内有像素空白时判为“需注意”。",
"Open this field in Aladin Lite ↗": "在 Aladin Lite 中打开这片天区 ↗",
"CDS sky viewer, showing the WISE infrared survey. Opens a new tab and sends it only this patch's coordinates.": "CDS 星空查看器，显示 WISE 红外巡天。会打开新标签页，只发送这个天区的坐标。",
