"Sending a vote needs a free GitHub account and creates a public issue in the team's repository (kneha07/WANDERERS), showing your vote and your GitHub name.": "提交投票需要一个免费的 GitHub 账号，并会在团队仓库（kneha07/WANDERERS）创建一个公开 issue，显示你的投票和你的 GitHub 名字。",
