"keeps movers seen in at least 12 visits whose motion is measured at 10σ or better, and hides those at a tile edge, in a crowded spot, saturated, or classed as likely artefacts.": "只保留至少在 12 次巡天中看到、运动测量达到 10σ 或更好的移动天体，并隐藏位于图块边缘、拥挤位置、已饱和或被归为可能伪影的天体。",
"Red": "红色",
"is a hint, not proof: cold brown dwarfs are red in W1−W2 because methane absorbs their light in W1 (3.4 µm). Filters and sort are kept in the address, so a shared link shows the same list.": "只是提示，不是证据：冷褐矮星在 W1−W2 中是红色的，因为甲烷吸收了它们在 W1 (3.4 µm) 的光。筛选和排序会保存在网址中，所以分享链接会显示同样的列表。",
