"Everything is computed on your phone. Motion data never leaves it; your location only leaves it rounded to about 50 km, to fetch NASA's satellite picture of your region.": "所有计算都在你的手机上完成。运动数据不会离开手机;你的位置只会取整到约 50 km 后发出,用来获取 NASA 拍的你所在地区的卫星图片。",
