"Lay your phone flat on a table": "把手机平放在桌上",
"Screen up, hands off, away from laptops and magnets. Hold still until the first dot fills, then give it a quarter turn on the table and hold again: four times.": "屏幕朝上,松开手,远离笔记本电脑和磁铁。保持不动,直到第一个圆点填满,然后在桌上转四分之一圈,再保持不动:一共四次。",
"Why four? The gyroscope knows exactly how far you turned. If the compass disagrees, something nearby is bending it, and averaging four directions cancels the phone's own magnetic bias.": "为什么是四次?陀螺仪准确知道你转了多少。如果指南针不同意,说明附近有东西在干扰它;而把四个方向取平均,就能抵消手机自身的磁偏差。",
