"Where the numbers come from": "数据从哪里来",
"Motion: the gyroscope drives every movement; the compass only sets north, averaged while the phone lies flat and corrected slowly after (sensor fusion, tested on simulated noisy sensors: 0.1–0.5° error, 0.1° wobble). Sky: J2000 positions precessed to today (IAU 1976), UTC time and Earth's rotation (IAU 1982 sidereal time) at your GPS position, refraction (Saemundsson). Magnetic north to true north: NOAA/BGS World Magnetic Model 2025. Earth imagery: NASA Blue Marble and Black Marble via NASA GIBS. Cities: GeoNames.": "运动:每一个动作都由陀螺仪驱动;指南针只用来确定北方,在手机平放时取平均,之后再缓慢修正(传感器融合,已用模拟的噪声传感器测试:误差 0.1–0.5°,抖动 0.1°)。天空:J2000 位置岁差修正到今天 (IAU 1976),在你的 GPS 位置使用 UTC 时间和地球自转 (IAU 1982 恒星时),并做大气折射修正 (Saemundsson)。磁北到真北:NOAA/BGS World Magnetic Model 2025。地球影像:NASA Blue Marble 和 Black Marble,经由 NASA GIBS 提供。城市:GeoNames。",
